10. PRECIOUS METAL ACCOUNTING ENGINE
==================================================

Build a dedicated precious-metal ledger.

Track:

- Gold quantity
- Silver quantity
- Purity
- Fine-metal equivalents
- Gross weight
- Net metal weight
- Recoverable metal
- Metal issued
- Metal received
- Metal in custody
- Metal losses
- Scrap
- Adjustments

Track physical material and financial value
as separate dimensions.

Example:

Net metal weight = 10.000 g

Fineness = 916/1000

